    "sentence_translations": [
      "An unlucky day",
      "",
      "When Little Ming woke up in the morning he saw that the window was not closed.",
      "All the books on his desk were wet from the rain.",
      "After cleaning his room, Little Ming decided to go shopping.",
      "The moment he got off the bus he was hit by a bike, but luckily he was uninjured.",
      "There were lots of people in the shopping mall, and Little Ming’s wallet was stolen.",
      "He then decided to go back home.",
      "When he arrived at the door, Little Ming realized his key was locked inside the room.",
      "He wanted to call his mom, but he dropped his phone on the ground and it broke.",
      "What an unlucky day, Little Ming thought.",
      ""
